WEBVTT

01:05.730 --> 01:06.770
<b>What happened?</b>

01:12.610 --> 01:15.280
<b>Simulacrum. Memory loss...</b>

01:17.410 --> 01:18.910
<b>Did I plan for this?</b>

01:41.350 --> 01:42.510
<b>No time to waste.</b>

01:44.770 --> 01:47.310
<b>The world is waiting.</b>

01:53.900 --> 01:54.820
<b>What's wrong?!</b>

02:01.280 --> 02:02.410
<b>The hell just happened?</b>

02:03.620 --> 02:06.500
<b>Don’t know, don’t care.
We’re surrounded. Let’s go.</b>

02:09.170 --> 02:10.000
<b>Brandt...</b>

02:10.920 --> 02:11.750
<b>Sarah!</b>

02:18.800 --> 02:23.430
<b><i>XM will change the future.</i>
<i>Are you ready?</i></b>

03:59.280 --> 04:01.530
<b>What... is going on?</b>

04:03.910 --> 04:04.740
<b>Look!</b>

04:09.410 --> 04:11.080
<b>A Dark XM Portal!</b>

04:15.960 --> 04:19.880
<b>Our useless bodies have caged us
since the dawn of man.</b>

04:21.800 --> 04:26.890
<b>Our souls, our minds.
They can be free. They can be infinite.</b>

04:28.550 --> 04:30.060
<b>The path is now open.</b>

04:31.390 --> 04:34.230
<b>It’s time to unite.
One consciousness. One truth.</b>

05:07.180 --> 05:10.510
<b>-How is this happening? Can we stop it?
-Someone betrayed us! Who?!</b>

05:16.690 --> 05:17.520
<b>No! I can pay!</b>

05:31.280 --> 05:34.700
<b>This is bad...
Dark XM Portals everywhere.</b>

05:41.210 --> 05:43.500
<b>Too strong. Not enough Bursters.</b>

05:44.550 --> 05:45.760
<b>This is very bad.</b>

05:45.840 --> 05:48.590
<b>The Dark XM’s spreading...</b>

05:50.180 --> 05:52.720
<b>This can’t have been
the Collaborators’ plan.</b>

05:54.310 --> 05:55.810
<b>It's not the Collaborators.</b>

05:57.390 --> 06:00.100
<b>Brandt’s the one who did this. His plan.</b>

06:02.440 --> 06:08.360
<b>I met him in the XM Substrate.
He told me he had a plan.</b>

06:09.610 --> 06:10.820
<b>You said he was dead!</b>

06:11.570 --> 06:13.870
<b>Why would you sit on this?
What else are you hiding?</b>

06:14.990 --> 06:16.700
<b>I didn’t mean to hide it.</b>

06:17.660 --> 06:19.460
<b>We haven’t had the time.</b>

06:20.210 --> 06:24.050
<b>He is alive. And dead.
Just like you are.</b>

06:26.170 --> 06:31.550
<b>So the Brandt who came to Hulong
was a Dark XM Simulacrum.</b>

06:31.640 --> 06:32.470
<b>I think so.</b>

06:32.550 --> 06:35.010
<b>The question is, where is he now?</b>

06:45.020 --> 06:47.150
<b>The illusion of death was necessary.</b>

06:49.490 --> 06:53.160
<b><i>You... You could have trusted me.</i></b>

07:02.130 --> 07:06.250
<b>Not with this, my friend.
I promised to save humanity from itself.</b>

07:07.760 --> 07:09.840
<b>That was my burden to bear alone.</b>

07:10.510 --> 07:15.300
<b>The Collaborators were driving this world
into chaos.</b>

07:15.390 --> 07:19.430
<b>But their greed has now served my purpose.</b>

07:19.850 --> 07:22.940
<b>I don’t get it.
Is all this your doing?</b>

07:23.940 --> 07:25.940
<b><i>This was always the plan, Jack.</i></b>

07:26.520 --> 07:30.900
<b>I’m creating the world we dreamed of.
That you died to protect.</b>

07:31.650 --> 07:32.950
<b>You didn’t let me die.</b>

07:34.490 --> 07:36.950
<b>Instead, you turned me
into this accursed thing.</b>

07:37.580 --> 07:40.290
<b><i>It’s not a curse. It’s a blessing.</i></b>

07:41.540 --> 07:45.790
<b>Why do you think I sacrificed my own life?
I’ve solved the memory loss.</b>

07:47.000 --> 07:49.800
<b><i>I will do the same for you, Jack.</i></b>

07:51.880 --> 07:53.090
<b>It’s too late.</b>

07:54.930 --> 07:57.600
<b>Liu burned up my body in Abaddon.</b>

07:58.720 --> 08:00.180
<b>A wasted effort.</b>

08:00.270 --> 08:02.940
<b>Liu’s a dog on a leash.
The science eluded him.</b>

08:03.810 --> 08:09.070
<b>A Simulacrum’s body cannot be destroyed
while that Simulacrum exists.</b>

08:11.240 --> 08:17.030
<b>It’s basic quantum entanglement.
The two halves are inseparable. Eternal.</b>

08:18.740 --> 08:20.040
<b>Sure. Basic.</b>

08:20.660 --> 08:23.120
<b><i>Jack, my old friend. You must trust me.</i></b>

08:24.580 --> 08:27.590
<b>I wouldn’t do all of this
without a reason.</b>

08:28.790 --> 08:32.130
<b>But before you can Recurse,
I have one last favor to ask.</b>

08:33.130 --> 08:37.090
<b><i>Sarah is the key. You must bring her here.</i></b>

08:38.390 --> 08:40.970
<b><i>It’s time to come home. You know where.</i></b>

08:42.350 --> 08:43.520
<b>Table Mountain.</b>

08:44.640 --> 08:46.940
<b><i>Don’t delay, our time is limited.</i></b>

08:50.900 --> 08:52.280
<b><i>Don’t worry.</i></b>

08:53.530 --> 08:55.700
<b><i>Your journey has already been arranged.</i></b>

08:59.120 --> 09:01.080
<b><i>Please. Don’t let me down.</i></b>

09:06.170 --> 09:07.000
<b>Damn it.</b>

09:08.210 --> 09:09.420
<b>Let’s go. Jack!</b>

09:10.920 --> 09:14.970
<b>Look around. Whatever Brandt’s up to,
we have to stop him.</b>

09:15.840 --> 09:18.260
<b>This is only the beginning.
We must contain it.</b>

09:18.930 --> 09:21.510
<b>We’re the only ones.
No one else knows what’s going on.</b>

09:22.810 --> 09:26.600
<b>Everything we’ve done so far.
It’s all for nothing if we don’t end this.</b>

09:28.190 --> 09:30.270
<b>We’re with you. Come on.</b>

09:35.070 --> 09:36.450
<b>You’ve really changed, kid.</b>

09:38.360 --> 09:39.200
<b>Alright.</b>

09:39.990 --> 09:42.120
<b>Guess it’s time to face my maker.</b>

09:47.960 --> 09:48.790
<b>Jack!</b>

09:50.670 --> 09:52.090
<b>Come on. Not these guys again!</b>

09:52.750 --> 09:53.590
<b>Dammit!</b>

10:00.800 --> 10:01.640
<b>Jack!</b>

10:01.720 --> 10:02.560
<b>Get outta here!</b>

10:02.640 --> 10:03.470
<b>No!</b>

10:04.350 --> 10:05.600
<b>Jump on, let’s go!</b>

10:06.850 --> 10:09.350
<b>You two look out for each other!</b>

10:10.860 --> 10:13.020
<b>Don’t worry! I’ll be right behind you!</b>

10:14.650 --> 10:15.480
<b>Give ‘em hell.</b>

10:21.660 --> 10:23.200
<b>Should’ve stayed on the plane.</b>

10:33.790 --> 10:35.130
<b>Sarah...</b>

10:39.590 --> 10:40.430
<b>He’s down!</b>

10:43.640 --> 10:46.850
<b>Another crazy in a Hulong visor.
I don’t like it.</b>

10:47.680 --> 10:50.230
<b>We got lucky that nobody got hurt yet.</b>

10:50.900 --> 10:54.110
<b>Inspector! We’ve got another one
over on Beach Street!</b>

10:54.190 --> 10:55.730
<b>Perp’s in a visor, too.</b>

10:57.230 --> 11:00.400
<b>Damn it! I can’t believe what’s happening!</b>

11:02.780 --> 11:06.040
<b><i>Emergency. Mob violence at Ebisubashi.</i>
<i>Many injured...</i></b>

11:06.120 --> 11:07.790
<b>Whoa, whoa, whoa!</b>

11:08.160 --> 11:10.040
<b>This is bad. Real bad.</b>

11:10.790 --> 11:13.920
<b>Red Portals all over the damn place.
And they’re spreading.</b>

11:15.170 --> 11:17.670
<b>Why do I feel like this has something
to do with you...</b>

11:18.510 --> 11:19.340
<b>Makoto.</b>

11:42.660 --> 11:45.070
<b>I was getting worried about you.</b>

11:50.330 --> 11:52.870
<b>Brandt. It’s time for us to have a talk.</b>

11:53.960 --> 11:55.380
<b>Where’s Jack?</b>

11:55.460 --> 11:59.000
<b>He... stayed behind to cover our escape.</b>

11:59.630 --> 12:01.720
<b>Loyal to a fault. What a shame.</b>

12:02.260 --> 12:05.760
<b>But he did accomplish his mission.</b>

12:06.550 --> 12:09.930
<b>And that mission was you, Sarah.</b>

12:12.310 --> 12:15.730
<b>Now what? You wanted me. I’m here. Why?</b>

12:17.820 --> 12:21.440
<b>Without you, everything I’ve done
would be meaningless.</b>

12:23.400 --> 12:29.450
<b>I believed science was a force for good.
Something to elevate us.</b>

12:30.240 --> 12:34.080
<b>But people’s greed, rage and selfishness
snuffed out that belief.</b>

12:35.000 --> 12:39.000
<b>When a great mind gave the world a gift,
it was corrupted.</b>

12:39.750 --> 12:44.180
<b>Tainted with smoke and blood.
The venom of hate.</b>

12:44.680 --> 12:48.260
<b>Our destiny was inevitable.
A failed species. An echo in time.</b>

12:49.180 --> 12:51.640
<b>But then I found the Substrate.</b>

12:53.430 --> 12:55.850
<b>You're the one who decided
to end the human race...</b>

12:56.650 --> 12:58.560
<b>By killing us, with Dark XM!</b>

12:58.730 --> 12:59.570
<b>No!</b>

13:00.230 --> 13:02.030
<b>This is merely the beginning!</b>

13:04.110 --> 13:08.700
<b>The soul exists beyond the body.
It is a system of data.</b>

13:09.160 --> 13:12.450
<b>And the Portals can channel that data
into the Substrate.</b>

13:13.250 --> 13:17.210
<b>Do you understand, Sarah?
This is beyond evolution...</b>

13:17.290 --> 13:19.710
<b>This is transcendence.
A refactoring of our species.</b>

13:20.340 --> 13:23.880
<b>We can repair what’s broken.
Give humanity another chance.</b>

13:24.550 --> 13:26.800
<b>Another... chance at what?</b>

13:27.760 --> 13:30.720
<b>Retaining the best and eliminating
the worst parts of ourselves</b>

13:31.310 --> 13:34.430
<b>But for that to happen,
you must guide us.</b>

13:36.600 --> 13:43.110
<b>Your Sensitive abilities allow you to cast
a signal into the XM. An idea. A feeling.</b>

13:43.940 --> 13:46.110
<b>This power belongs to you, and you alone.</b>

13:47.700 --> 13:54.080
<b>That’s why Liu captured you,
to use that power for their gain.</b>

13:54.750 --> 13:57.710
<b>But I ask you to use it
for something noble.</b>

13:59.880 --> 14:02.340
<b>Giving them a path into the substrate,</b>

14:02.420 --> 14:04.630
<b>I have liberated
humanity’s minds and souls.</b>

14:05.420 --> 14:08.180
<b>But they are lost in there.
Confused and afraid.</b>

14:10.550 --> 14:11.430
<b>They need guidance.</b>

14:12.510 --> 14:16.850
<b>Yes. The guidance that only you
can provide them.</b>

14:16.930 --> 14:20.310
<b>A helping hand toward their new home.</b>

14:21.610 --> 14:25.940
<b>They will follow us
on the path that we create.</b>

14:28.150 --> 14:30.660
<b>Destruction will breed creation.</b>

14:30.740 --> 14:34.740
<b>We will save our species, Sarah.
That is our plan.</b>

14:36.040 --> 14:38.500
<b>This plan. When did it all start?</b>

14:39.370 --> 14:43.170
<b>Four years ago.
The day that Jack became a Simulacrum.</b>

14:43.460 --> 14:45.920
<b>So the Hulong explosion, that was all you?</b>

14:46.300 --> 14:48.470
<b>I sacrificed myself to awaken you.</b>

14:49.010 --> 14:52.010
<b>My destruction was
a small price to pay for that.</b>

14:54.050 --> 14:57.430
<b>A simulacrum is Dark XM contained.
Stable for 1331 days.</b>

14:57.980 --> 15:02.270
<b>When the container breaks,
all that energy is released.</b>

15:03.520 --> 15:06.610
<b>A “Violent Recursion.”
One I could perform on command.</b>

15:07.030 --> 15:09.190
<b>What if you’d killed her?!</b>

15:10.150 --> 15:14.410
<b>My decisions are always calculated.
It was a risk, but a necessary one.</b>

15:16.240 --> 15:21.870
<b>Hulong contained her. I would awaken her
or risk all of humanity.</b>

15:23.250 --> 15:27.170
<b>I trusted Jack could handle the rest.
Wittingly or not.</b>

15:29.260 --> 15:34.390
<b>Now everything has fallen into place.
Come, there is so much for us to do.</b>

15:34.760 --> 15:36.890
<b>Or I could shoot you.
Put an end to all this.</b>

15:36.970 --> 15:38.390
<b>I’m sure you could, but won’t.</b>

15:39.180 --> 15:42.020
<b>You see the promise of my new world.</b>

15:43.600 --> 15:47.980
<b>The old world is crumbling,
we can shape the new one together.</b>

15:53.490 --> 15:57.370
<b>There’s no path now but forward.
Tell me you’ll join me.</b>

16:01.750 --> 16:05.250
<b>You think I’m all out of options.
That I’ll just submit.</b>

16:06.960 --> 16:11.970
<b>That I’m a shut-in who won the lottery.
Was born a Sensitive.</b>

16:13.430 --> 16:15.430
<b>An oddball with a curse to exploit.</b>

16:18.060 --> 16:18.890
<b>Maybe I was.</b>

16:19.850 --> 16:20.980
<b>Until I met Sarah.</b>

16:21.430 --> 16:25.060
<b>She taught me about XM and Portals,
and I became something more.</b>

16:26.520 --> 16:29.400
<b>Since this journey started,
I’ve seen unimaginable things.</b>

16:30.280 --> 16:34.110
<b>Done things I wasn’t capable of doing.
I’m a different person now.</b>

16:34.570 --> 16:38.950
<b>Better. The world threw chaos at me,
and I learned to face it.</b>

16:41.160 --> 16:43.870
<b>In this new world of yours,
people won’t grow.</b>

16:44.920 --> 16:47.630
<b>Watching Makoto and Jack
through everything they faced...</b>

16:49.000 --> 16:52.210
<b>Seeing them learn to respect
and understand each other...</b>

16:52.760 --> 16:55.510
<b>Helping one another,
elevating themselves...</b>

16:56.970 --> 16:59.810
<b>That’s what we’re about.
That’s humanity, Brandt.</b>

17:02.060 --> 17:05.810
<b>You claim to see the good in things,
I get it.</b>

17:06.440 --> 17:09.440
<b>But you’ve given up on us.
It’s clear you’re on the wrong path.</b>

17:14.860 --> 17:17.320
<b>I see. That’s truly a pity.</b>

17:19.740 --> 17:24.460
<b>But I'm confident you'll soon come around
to thinking more clearly.</b>

17:25.460 --> 17:29.750
<b>Where the hell are you going, Brandt?!
You need to stop this!</b>

17:29.840 --> 17:33.340
<b>Sorry that you feel this way, Sarah.
But I don’t care.</b>

17:39.180 --> 17:40.260
<b>Dark XM!</b>

17:47.480 --> 17:48.310
<b>Makoto!</b>

17:50.480 --> 17:53.480
<b>Your mind is no different than any other.
Malleable.</b>

17:59.070 --> 18:01.780
<b>I know I can protect us!</b>

18:06.500 --> 18:07.330
<b>Sarah!</b>

18:07.790 --> 18:08.620
<b>Get the door!</b>

18:09.040 --> 18:09.920
<b>Right!</b>

18:13.630 --> 18:14.800
<b>Dammit!</b>

18:21.180 --> 18:24.600
<b>I don’t know if I can do this!</b>

18:25.640 --> 18:26.480
<b>Brandt!</b>

18:26.980 --> 18:28.770
<b>Is this how your perfect world starts?</b>

18:29.440 --> 18:31.940
<b>There must be something...</b>

18:32.820 --> 18:36.240
<b>A Simulacrum is Dark XM contained.
Stable for 1331 days.</b>

18:36.530 --> 18:40.820
<b>When the container breaks,
all that energy is released.</b>

18:55.460 --> 18:56.300
<b>Makoto.</b>

19:00.130 --> 19:01.550
<b>I’ll need your strength.</b>

19:03.140 --> 19:04.760
<b>We all have a part to play.</b>

19:06.220 --> 19:08.100
<b>It’s time for me to play my own.</b>

19:11.400 --> 19:12.230
<b>Sarah?</b>

19:25.200 --> 19:26.200
<b>Good, Sarah.</b>

19:26.620 --> 19:28.080
<b>Discover yourself.</b>

19:28.950 --> 19:32.790
<b>Your power is so beautiful!</b>

19:35.790 --> 19:37.130
<b>Sarah!</b>

19:38.590 --> 19:39.460
<b>Sarah!</b>

19:40.670 --> 19:42.180
<b>Don't do this! Stop!</b>

20:10.700 --> 20:11.540
<b>Sarah...</b>

21:20.690 --> 21:22.320
<b>This is not...</b>

21:23.610 --> 21:25.450
<b>How my story ends!</b>

22:53.990 --> 22:55.990
<b>Subtitle Translation by Rika Takahashi</b>
